{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 94146, "game_id": 1164, "entry_id": 66474, "uid": 82806, "type": 4, "title": "木人偶选择攻略（PVE）", "tag": "0", "created_at": 1639292404, "updated_at": 1639891949, "updated_uid": 0, "comment_at": 1639891949, "last_at": 0, "comment_count": 0, "status": 1, "summary": "※标红的为增伤、加速、减防人偶，对伤害有比较明显提升※标紫色的为队长技增强人偶，这类人偶技能大部分都跟原有队长技不冲突※黑色为加盾、回血、吸血、追伤等人偶，对伤害提升不明显1.橙色木炮人偶，NS给予自", "thumb": "", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 4, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 5415, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 0, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 0, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 94146, "content": "<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;background:rgb(255,255,255);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);\">※标红的为增伤、加速、减防人偶，对伤害有比较明显提升</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;background:rgb(255,255,255);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(177,56,206);\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;background:transparent;\">※</span>标紫色的为队长技增强人偶，这类人偶技能大部分都跟原有队长技不冲突</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;background:rgb(255,255,255);\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;background:transparent;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">※黑</span>色为加盾、回血、吸血、追伤等人偶，对伤害提升不明显</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"></div></span><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639275527387_86930002.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639275527387_86930002.png\" style=\"width:165px;height:165px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);\">1.橙色木炮人偶，NS给予自身弱点伤害+40%，SS自身吸血，队长技我方弱点最终攻击伤害+10%，更适合RD的人偶，木系RD目前没有弱点增伤辅助，可以考虑给尤娜，全面增伤，WB不是很有用</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639275940259_49552764.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639275940259_49552764.png\" style=\"width:165px;height:165px;\"></div><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);\">2.<span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);font-size:14px;\">紫色</span>圣诞妹，DS给予敌方爆弹，队长技我方SS最终伤害+7.5%，<span style=\"font-size:14px;\">RD时可以给你的RD队长，增加伤害，WB时<span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);font-size:14px;\">给木人鱼，进一步增强队长技效果</span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639276007385_61039295.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639276007385_61039295.png\" style=\"width:165px;height:165px;\"></div><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);\">3.<span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);font-size:14px;\">紫色</span>仓鼠，SS给予木属性我方2体DEBUFF持续时间-15%，队长技我方全体技能充能速度+7.5%，<span style=\"font-size:14px;\">给木人鱼，进一步增强队长技效果</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639276120735_42385540.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639276120735_42385540.png\" style=\"width:165px;height:165px;\"></div><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);\">4.<span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);font-size:14px;\">紫色</span>木基佬，SS给予敌方12秒弱点防御-20%，<span style=\"font-size:14px;\">更适合RD的人偶，可以考虑给木双刃，进一步增伤，WB不是很有用</span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639276320991_95736583.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639276320991_95736583.png\" style=\"width:165px;height:165px;\"></div>5.<span style=\"font-size:14px;\">紫色</span>高</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">达，NS给予水属性敌方250追加伤害，SS给予自身300HP吸血，给木刀增加点FT伤害，聊胜于无的选择</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639276699466_78615141.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639276699466_78615141.png\" style=\"width:165px;height:165px;\"></div>6.蓝色木弓，SS给予水属性敌方350追加伤害，给木刀增加点SS伤害，<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">聊胜于无的选择</span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639277130759_90777564.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639277130759_90777564.png\" style=\"width:165px;height:165px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);\">7.蓝色木吉他，队长技基于水属性敌方弱点防御-5%，<span style=\"font-size:14px;\">更适合RD的人偶，可以考虑给你的RD队队长，全面增伤，</span>WB没啥用</span></div></span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639277345042_41280875.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639277345042_41280875.png\" style=\"width:165px;height:165px;\"></div><span style=\"color:rgb(177,56,206);\">8.蓝色章鱼妹，队长技给予我方木属性SS攻击力+5%，</span><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(177,56,206);\">可以给你的RD队队长，增加伤害，WB也可以给木人鱼，<span style=\"font-size:14px;\">增加伤害</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639277610565_65185110.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639277610565_65185110.png\" style=\"width:165px;height:165px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\">9.蓝色向日葵，队长技给予我方木属性200HP回复的吸血，稍微增加点生存，<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">可以给你的RD队队长</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639277867731_41126255.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639277867731_41126255.png\" style=\"width:165px;height:165px;\"></div><br style=\"\"></span></div><span style=\"color:rgb(177,56,206);\">10.蓝色木伪娘，<span style=\"font-size:14px;\">队长技给予我方木属性SS技能最终伤害+5%，</span><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">可以给你的RD队队长，增加伤害，WB也可以给木人鱼，<span style=\"font-size:14px;\">增加伤害</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639278028081_83853447.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639278028081_83853447.png\" style=\"width:165px;height:165px;\"></div>11.蓝色刺客，SS给予自身16秒吸血，攻击时250HP回复，偏<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">RDRB向，当你的某个木属性成员容易死亡时，给他增加生存</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639278133320_14171005.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639278133320_14171005.png\" style=\"width:165px;height:165px;\"></div>12.蓝色木婚纱，NS给予我方剩余HP最少的1体10秒内盾+1150，<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">偏</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">RDRB向，WB稍微有点不够看，当然可以用，给女仆猫最好</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639278317659_15106154.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639278317659_15106154.png\" style=\"width:165px;height:165px;\"></div>13.蓝色玩偶，NS给予<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">水属性敌方225追加伤害，给木刀增加点FT伤害，</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">聊胜于无的选择</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639278396135_70596130.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639278396135_70596130.png\" style=\"width:165px;height:165px;\"></div><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);\">14。绿色草精灵，NS给予地方弱点防御-15%，满级-35%，绿色人偶，比较容易高加，<span style=\"font-size:14px;\">偏</span><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">RDRB向，相比木基佬人偶NS覆盖率更广，给女仆猫最好</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639289485215_27034119.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639289485215_27034119.png\" style=\"width:165px;height:165px;\"></div><span style=\"color:rgb(177,56,206);\">15.绿色三星基佬，队长技给予水属性敌方弱点防御-4%，<span style=\"font-size:14px;\">绿色人偶，比较</span></span><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(177,56,206);\">容易高加，<span style=\"font-size:14px;\">可以给你的RD队队长，增加伤害，WB也可以给木人鱼，</span><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">增加伤害</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639289656654_74140817.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639289656654_74140817.png\" style=\"width:165px;height:165px;\"></div>16.绿色猫娘，NS给予自身200HP吸血，<span style=\"font-size:14px;\">偏</span><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">R</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">DRB向，WB稍微有点不够看，当然可以用，<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">当你的某个木属性成员容易死亡时，给他增加生存</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639290016435_26290892.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639290016435_26290892.png\" style=\"width:165px;height:165px;\"></div>17.<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">绿色</span>太妹，NS给予自身300即时回复，<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">偏</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">R</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">DRB向，WB稍微有点不够看，当然可以用，<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">当你的某个木属性成员容易死亡时，给他增加生存</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639290088109_90911474.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639290088109_90911474.png\" style=\"width:165px;height:165px;\"></div>18.白色草水滴，NS给予木属性我方1体弱点攻击最终伤害+10%，容易高加，但不优先高攻，随机给人BUFF，没啥大用</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639290363252_39851742.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639290363252_39851742.png\" style=\"width:165px;height:165px;\"></div><spa